{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/92460fa0302fe9fab53d6601e7895678.poster.avif?t=1765903080\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/92460fa0302fe9fab53d6601e7895678.webm?t=1765903080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/92460fa0302fe9fab53d6601e7895678.mp4?t=1765903080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/ca75c4905f494c99d9096602696842ef.avif?t=1765903080\" width=900 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUN RUN RUN RUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ULTRA VERTIGO is a game about well... running. Be fast, be nimble, stay focused and get to the end as fast as you can. Modifiers and secrets will keep things fresh, go out there and explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/2fbd50399fc17e9cefe346dcea368862.avif?t=1765903080\" width=900 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLIMB CLIMB CLIMB CLIMB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump and climb as high as possible. The finish line lies at the very top of this huge vertical level. We hope you are not afraid of heights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessibility is important for us, so you will discover a wide array of customization options to tailor the game to your needs. Make it as easy or difficult as you want. Add a shadow, a cursor, checkpoints or even the ability to rewind the last few seconds of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/6783906e80368556000768b4ad00f34e.avif?t=1765903080\" width=900 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FALL FALL FALL FALL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, indeed, you will fall. Quite a lot. Of course, your legs are pretty strong, no fall damage or anything like that. The only damage you get from falling is emotional, as the level scrolls in front of you, showing all the progress you are losing while falling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/1ed8cd5897e46f2bb5883165aea3a796.avif?t=1765903080\" width=900 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RETRY RETRY RETRY RETRY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep running, keep climbing, keep falling, keep... retrying. Somewhere down the line you will succeed. It is only a matter of time, sweat and tears. Though, getting to the end of the level is only the beginning, as you can improve your time, discover new routes and find shortcuts!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Eiffel Tower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892250/2b1a107ec9b23a55db09b92baf7e779516d4ce9a.jpg"},{"name":"Head In The Clouds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892250/e6fde54953d6376289a7e64ce98822756c2b8027.jpg"},{"name":"All Modifiers!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892250/b4eea38b9a15420313bd1d7d516d9700ae917512.jpg"},{"name":"GG","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892250/aca71061cc7c76ac3399d85456a21d8c657243d0.jpg"},{"name":"GG WP","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892250/0173e199bcc8697c0a5feca466c1d4974ec44497.jpg"},{"name":"Teagher Room","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892250/f0ce0ee312eff23a8e93d75cb73e4638f7db52f9.jpg"},{"name":"Where are you?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892250/a5829041beaf84113090116c67aeaaefdf1ceceb.jpg"},{"name":"Secret within secret within secret","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892250/2f700d262157641ac27af90a1af4e873494b3013.jpg"},{"name":"Secret within secret within secret withing secret!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892250/7b93e1d8bcc51122877fdac2882c6074a37e922e.jpg"},{"name":"ODJV Forever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892250/3f6dc534021fa7ea86e2b9daacb94236f48c4609.jpg"}],"total":26},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3892250?t=1765903080","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/a100ce48eaa8fd90f40b7b22b5960a62efdd74ba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765903080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/931dcb0c7699f91933ea38c9faa49b09c8f942ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765903080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/931dcb0c7699f91933ea38c9faa49b09c8f942ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765903080","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4033290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/92460fa0302fe9fab53d6601e7895678.poster.avif?t=1765903080\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/92460fa0302fe9fab53d6601e7895678.webm?t=1765903080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/92460fa0302fe9fab53d6601e7895678.mp4?t=1765903080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/ca75c4905f494c99d9096602696842ef.avif?t=1765903080\" width=900 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUN RUN RUN RUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ULTRA VERTIGO is a game about well... running. Be fast, be nimble, stay focused and get to the end as fast as you can. Modifiers and secrets will keep things fresh, go out there and explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/2fbd50399fc17e9cefe346dcea368862.avif?t=1765903080\" width=900 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLIMB CLIMB CLIMB CLIMB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump and climb as high as possible. The finish line lies at the very top of this huge vertical level. We hope you are not afraid of heights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessibility is important for us, so you will discover a wide array of customization options to tailor the game to your needs. Make it as easy or difficult as you want. Add a shadow, a cursor, checkpoints or even the ability to rewind the last few seconds of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/6783906e80368556000768b4ad00f34e.avif?t=1765903080\" width=900 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FALL FALL FALL FALL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, indeed, you will fall. Quite a lot. Of course, your legs are pretty strong, no fall damage or anything like that. The only damage you get from falling is emotional, as the level scrolls in front of you, showing all the progress you are losing while falling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/extras/1ed8cd5897e46f2bb5883165aea3a796.avif?t=1765903080\" width=900 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RETRY RETRY RETRY RETRY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep running, keep climbing, keep falling, keep... retrying. Somewhere down the line you will succeed. It is only a matter of time, sweat and tears. Though, getting to the end of the level is only the beginning, as you can improve your time, discover new routes and find shortcuts!</p>","developers":["TEAGHER STUDIO"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892250/08618788e3e95fc8eb63fcc6bdec528d7aeffd36/header.jpg?t=1765903080","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamst